-$request_date
Referral date* $referral_date :date {default=today()}

:tab_container
 Patient details :tab $pat_tab
  S number/hospital no* $identifier @pat_number :text {size=10}
  
  :horiz_container
   First name* $first_name @pat_firstname :text {size=50}
   Last name* $last_name @pat_lastname :text {size=50}
  Date of birth $dob @pat_dob :date
  
 Referral details :tab $ref_det_tab
  :horiz_container
   Consultant title $consultant_title :text {size=5}
   Consultant first name $consultant_first_name :text
   Consultant surname $consultant_surname :text
  
  Email for correspondance $corresp_email :text

 Diagnosis :tab $diag_tab
  Does the patient have a confirmed rheumatological diagnosis? $confirmed_rheum_diagnosis :yes_no {condition_test=Y,condition_target=diagnosis,condition_action=show}
  Diagnosis $diagnosis :memo

  :horiz_container
   Rheumatoid factor or CCP $rheum_factor_ccp :radio_buttons [1=Not done/not known,2=Positive,3=Negative] 
   ANA $ana :radio_buttons [1=Not done/not known,2=Positive,3=Negative]


  Does patient have specific symptoms $any_specific_symps :yes_no {condition_test=Y,condition_target=spec_symptoms,condition_action=show}
  Specific symptoms :checkboxes {dictionary=spec_symptoms,columns=2} $spec_symptoms
  

 Lung function :tab
  Date of most recent full PFTs :date $date_recent_pfts
  Most recent FVC % predicted :number {suffix=%} $fvc_pc_pred
  Has patient had gas transfer? :yes_no $gas_transfer {condition_test=Y,condition_action=show,condition_target=gt_cn}
  
  :container $gt_cn
	  Most recent TLco % predicted :number {suffix=%} $tlco_pc_pred
	  Most recent KCO % predicted :number {suffix=%} $kco_pc_pred

 Biopsy :tab
  :horiz_container
   Has the patient had a biopsy? $patient_had_biopsy @has_the_patient_had_a_biopsy :radio_buttons [1=No,2=Yes and I know the result,3=Yes biopsy needs discussing] {condition_test=2;3,condition_action=show,condition_target=biopsy_result}
   Biopsy result :memo

  Is the patient fit for a biopsy? :yes_no $fit_for_biopsy {condition_test=Y,condition_action=show,condition_target=biopsy_referred}
  Do you want pt referred for biopsy from MDT? $biopsy_referred :radio_buttons [Y=Yes please see in clinic too,N=No please only discuss at the MDT]
  Are you referring patient to be seen? $refer_see_pt :radio_buttons [Y=Yes please see in clinic too,N=No please only discuss at the MDT]